      "id": "claim_9ba791dbed844c5580a211ab92b84b4a",
      "statement": "`DomainSpec` is the declarative contract for grounded retrieval and document access: grounded domains must have a `kb_name` or `search_index`, domains with `document_access=\"acl\"` must also have a `search_index`, and the configured `techdocs` and `selfwiki` specs both use ACL-based document access.",
