      "statement": "`knowledge.retrieve()` is the shared grounding seam for assistants: it uses native KB retrieval when `domain.kb_name` is present and direct search otherwise, sends the service call as the app identity, attaches the user OBO search token only for `document_access=\"acl\"` domains, and records retrieval access events without failing the answer path if auditing breaks.",
