      "id": "claim_b4e9fdef08b24b038ee03802059fca17",
      "statement": "`authorized_document()` fails closed for ACL domains: it validates the blob name, builds the blob URL from tenant storage and the domain corpus container, requires a user OBO search token when auth is enabled on `document_access=\"acl\"` domains, reauthorizes access against the search index with a `blob_url` filter, and only downloads the blob after authorization succeeds.",
